@startuml
title State diagram for Ott Based System Mini Reel

[*] --> Unregistered

state "Unregistered" as Unregistered
state "Registered" as Registered
state "Watching video" as WatchingVideo
state "Uploaded video" as UploadedVideo
state "Liked video list" as LikedVideoList
state "Discussion menu" as DiscussionMenu

Unregistered --> Registered : Create account

Registered --> WatchingVideo : Watch
Registered --> UploadedVideo : Upload
Registered --> LikedVideoList : View likes
Registered --> DiscussionMenu : Discuss

WatchingVideo --> Registered : Done watching
UploadedVideo --> Registered : Done uploading
LikendVideoList --> Registered : Done viewing
DiscussionMenu --> [*] : Exit

@enduml
